          "command": "git add packages/deploy-cloudflare/src/http/cf-express-bridge.ts \u0026\u0026 git commit -m \"$(cat \u003c\u003c'EOF'\nfix(deploy-cloudflare): prevent unhandled rejections from async handlers called via synchronous next()\n\nWhen validate() middleware calls next() synchronously, the actual route\nhandler runs inside an un-awaited Promise. If the handler throws asynchronously\n(e.g. DB error, unique constraint), the error becomes an unhandled rejection.\n\nFix: make runChain fire-and-forget — each handler is wrapped in Promise.resolve().catch()\nthat redirects errors to res._reject. Add _reject to MockRes so res.promise always\nsettles (either with a Response or an error). bridgeExpressHandlers now just awaits\nres.promise and handles the error in one place.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nEOF\n)\"",
